     "text": "Welcome to At the Races! Each week we bring you news and analysis from the CQ Roll Call campaign team. Know someone who\\u2019d like to get this newsletter? They can subscribe here . \\n \\n\\n \\n By Daniela Altimari , Mary Ellen McIntire and Niels Lesniewski \\n \\n\\n \\n DALLAS \\u2013 Recent national polls show President Donald Trump\\u2019s job approval rating sinking to historic lows, driven by deep dissatisfaction over rising prices, including gas topping $4 a gallon, fueled by an unpopular conflict with Iran and his tariffs policy. \\n \\n\\n \\n But if any of that has the Republican faithful feeli…",
